description	"Kit Fisto - Marshall

An aggressive and masterful Jedi duelist, but lacking reliable tools for dealing with blaster pressure.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Cyan/Blue)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Deflect (1)
-- 125% Spec Dmg mult
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more Dmg

- Aquatic Blasts
-- Based off Rocket Launcher, prim only 
-- 200% slower ROF and reload
-- 60% slower velocity
-- 30% less damage
-- Stuns on hit 

- Sonic Scream
-- Based off DC15, sec fire only 
-- Stuns on hit. ignores block
-- 500% slower rof, 80% slower velocity

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (1)
- Sense (3)

^8Attributes:
- Aerial Force Regen
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Force Block (3)
- Force Focus (2)
- Water Breathing"
